<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3921280774660095563..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: From OKC to Abu Ghraib: The Kenneth Trentadue Case</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>15</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3584854287498840180</id><published>2017-02-11T17:52:43.234-07:00</published><updated>2017-02-11T17:52:43.234-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The  FBI has  drawn blood like  this  numerous  ti...</title><content type='html'>The  FBI has  drawn blood like  this  numerous  times-THIS  MAN  WILL NOT  BE FORGOTTEN!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/3584854287498840180'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/3584854287498840180'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1486860763234#c3584854287498840180' title=''/><author><name>sunaj</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05977106778916942886</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-989647226"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 11, 2017 at 5:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5787977810855157170</id><published>2008-04-18T15:15:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-18T15:15:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Dale Williams of Salt Lake City&#39;s KTKK (&quot;K-Talk&quot;) ...</title><content type='html'>&lt;I&gt;Dale Williams of Salt Lake City&#39;s KTKK (&quot;K-Talk&quot;) invited me on for an hour last Thursday while he was filling in for Jack Stockwell. We discussed -- among other things -- my firing by the JBS (he brought up the subject, I didn&#39;t), the Free State project, the increasingly well-entrenched police state, and the right to resist arrest. I can&#39;t find an archive of that program; hopefully one will soon &lt;B&gt;materialize&lt;/B&gt;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;/I&gt; --Will&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Try this:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.awakeandarise.org/radio/Dale_Williams_WilliamGrigg_April_10_2008.mp3</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5787977810855157170'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5787977810855157170'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208553300000#c5787977810855157170' title=''/><author><name>JohnS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13489107681158170826</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97139791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 18, 2008 at 3:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4454459463862172545</id><published>2008-04-15T18:28:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-15T18:28:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, great essay, as usual. Thanks for including ...</title><content type='html'>Will, great essay, as usual. Thanks for including the links to your radio interviews. I &lt;B&gt;had&lt;/B&gt; been thinking that your skills at self-promotion are somewhat lacking. Seems like many times you wouldn&#39;t even think to mention this blog if Dr. Stan didn&#39;t prod you for the info...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/4454459463862172545'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/4454459463862172545'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208305680000#c4454459463862172545' title=''/><author><name>JohnS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13489107681158170826</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-97139791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 15, 2008 at 6:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6322198354547063166</id><published>2008-04-15T17:26:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-15T17:26:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I recall that some fellow was interviewed by Scott...</title><content type='html'>I recall that some fellow was interviewed by Scott Horton over at AntiWar.com about OKC and believe they discussed this beating &quot;suicide&quot;.  In any event they&#39;re all cover-ups and &quot;accidents&quot; to silence anyone who gets too close for their own health.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/6322198354547063166'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/6322198354547063166'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208301960000#c6322198354547063166' title=''/><author><name>MOT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://www.dailydiktat.com/biohazard.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 15, 2008 at 5:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8440364772368819128</id><published>2008-04-14T23:46:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T23:46:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for writing this blog, Will.  The OKC case ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for writing this blog, Will.  The OKC case never leaves my thoughts for more than a few days at a time, and the murder of Kenny Trentadue (and Terry Yeakey) REALLY sticks in my craw.  The thought of ATF &quot;officers&quot; showing up after the fact to be heroes royally galls me.&lt;BR/&gt;Like the attacks of 9/11, the OKC bombing was demonstrably a government op from start to finish, designed to sway public opinion toward more police state controls on we the people and to grease the skids for such police state enabling legislation.&lt;BR/&gt;The OKC bombing and subsequent coverup stink to high heaven.  I hope and pray that, ultimately, the truth will prevail.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/8440364772368819128'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/8440364772368819128'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208238360000#c8440364772368819128' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 11:46 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5217075391311828893</id><published>2008-04-14T23:00:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T23:00:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Very much related to Mr. Grigg&#39;s above article, th...</title><content type='html'>Very much related to Mr. Grigg&#39;s above article, the below documentation ought to be of interest to everyone here:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Germany&#39;s top neo-Nazis spy for ministry,&quot; Hannah Cleaver, Telegraph (U.K.), July 16, 2002 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2002/07/16/wgerm16.xml&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2002/07/16/wgerm16.xml&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://web.archive.org/web/20030410195340/http://news.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2002/07/16/wgerm16.xml&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://web.archive.org/web/20030410195340/http://news.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2002/07/16/wgerm16.xml&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Neo-Nazi leader &#39;was MI6 agent,&#39;&quot; John Hooper, Guardian (U.K.), August 13, 2002 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.guardian.co.uk/international/story/0,3604,773568,00.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.guardian.co.uk/international/story/0,3604,773568,00.html&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Neo-Nazis run rings around German intelligence services,&quot; Tony Paterson, Telegraph (U.K.), March 16, 2003 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.opinion.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2003/03/16/wnazi16.xml&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.opinion.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2003/03/16/wnazi16.xml&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://web.archive.org/web/20030413232754/http://news.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2003/03/16/wnazi16.xml&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://web.archive.org/web/20030413232754/http://news.telegraph.co.uk/news/main.jhtml?xml=/news/2003/03/16/wnazi16.xml&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Quest to ban neo-Nazis ends in farce,&quot; Allan Hall, The Scotsman, March 19, 2003 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://news.scotsman.com/international.cfm?id=330602003&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://news.scotsman.com/international.cfm?id=330602003&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Report: Police arrest IDF soldier suspected of belonging to neo-Nazi group,&quot; Jonathan Lis, Haaretz, May 5, 2005 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.haaretz.com/hasen/objects/pages/PrintArticleEn.jhtml?itemNo=572832&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.haaretz.com/hasen/objects/pages/PrintArticleEn.jhtml?itemNo=572832&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Excerpt from the above article:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;Police on Wednesday arrested an Israel Defense Forces soldier suspected of belonging to a neo-Nazi group, Army Radio reported Thursday.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A detective squad detained the soldier, a new immigrant and a resident of the Ariel settlement in the West Bank, after his behavior aroused suspicion. Officers found heroin in his vehicle, Israel Radio reported.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Upon his arrest, the soldier told police he was a neo-Nazi and that he hated the state. A swastika was found tattooed on his left arm.&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Police arrest neo-Nazi IDF soldier,&quot; IsraelInsider, May 5, 2005 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://web.israelinsider.com/Articles/Briefs/5483.htm&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://web.israelinsider.com/Articles/Briefs/5483.htm&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Police Discover Ring of Neo-Nazi Immigrants from CIS,&quot; Israel National News, June 2, 2005 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://web.archive.org/web/20050613080612/http://www.israelnationalnews.com/news.php3?id=83115&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://web.archive.org/web/20050613080612/http://www.israelnationalnews.com/news.php3?id=83115&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Excerpt from the above article:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;The neo-Nazi group was discovered following the arrest on drug charges of a 20-year-old IDF soldier. A swastika tattooed on his arm aroused police suspicions, and neo-Nazi material was later discovered in his home.&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Neo-Nazi rally was organized by FBI informant,&quot; Henry Pierson Curtis with contribution from Rene Stutzman, Jim Leusner and Willoughby Mariano, Orlando Sentinel, February 15, 2007 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.geocities.com/psyop911/neo-nazi-rally-was-organized-by-fbi-informant.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.geocities.com/psyop911/neo-nazi-rally-was-organized-by-fbi-informant.html&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.geocities.com/psyop911/27930152.pdf&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.geocities.com/psyop911/27930152.pdf&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://web.archive.org/web/20070224053847/http://www.orlandosentinel.com/news/local/orange/orl-mhate1507feb15,0,4658933.story&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://web.archive.org/web/20070224053847/http://www.orlandosentinel.com/news/local/orange/orl-mhate1507feb15,0,4658933.story&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Police: Israeli Neo-Nazi Ring Busted,&quot; Amy Teibel, Associated Press (AP), September 9, 2007 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.forbes.com/feeds/ap/2007/09/09/ap4096684.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.forbes.com/feeds/ap/2007/09/09/ap4096684.html&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Excerpt from the above article:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;In a case that would seem unthinkable in the Jewish state, police said Sunday they have cracked a cell of young Israeli neo-Nazis accused in a string of attacks on foreign workers, religious Jews, drug addicts and gays.&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Ministers: Police Destroyed Klan Records,&quot; Associated Press (AP), February 26, 2008 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.baynews9.com/content/36/2008/2/26/327910.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.baynews9.com/content/36/2008/2/26/327910.html&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;----------&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Again related to the above, see the below post by me which provides extensive documentation concerning its titular subject:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;British Government Staged IRA Terrorism,&quot; TetrahedronOmega, August 24, 2007 &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.armleg.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=121&amp;mforum=libertyandtruth&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.armleg.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=121&amp;mforum=libertyandtruth&lt;/A&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5217075391311828893'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5217075391311828893'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208235600000#c5217075391311828893' title=''/><author><name>James Redford</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11284915453745539533</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://img219.imageshack.us/img219/7466/swirla128negbz3.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1851225259"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 11:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-332621752895809174</id><published>2008-04-14T16:13:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T16:13:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>From the Deseret News article:&quot;Trentadue said the ...</title><content type='html'>From the Deseret News article:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Trentadue said the effort to hide information from him comes from the top ranks of the Justice Department.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Got to wonder who they&#39;re covering up for. Did Janet Reno herself sign his brother&#39;s torture and execution warrant?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;If so, nobody in the current administration is going to be shocked. As Dan Froomkin reports, torturing is standard procedure now, directed straight from the White House:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;------------&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;President Bush says he was aware that his top aides met in the White House basement to micromanage the application of waterboarding and other widely-condemned interrogation techniques. And he says it was no big deal.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;I&#39;m aware our national security team met on this issue. And I approved,&quot; Bush told ABC News&#39; Martha Raddatz on Friday. &quot;I don&#39;t know what&#39;s new about that; I&#39;m not so sure what&#39;s so startling about that.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It&#39;s true that it has been widely assumed and occasionally reported that the CIA&#39;s use of brutal interrogation techniques could be traced back to the White House on a general level. But it was most definitely new last week when ABC News reported that a group of Bush&#39;s top aides, including Vice President Cheney, took part in meetings where they explicitly discussed and approved -- literally blow by blow -- tactics such as waterboarding. And while Bush has previously defended these tactics -- vaguely, and insisting against all evidence that they did not amount to torture -- he had not, until now, acknowledged that he personally OK&#39;d them beforehand.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://tinyurl.com/4zshsy&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;------------&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I wish the above were from some dystopian novel. But it&#39;s from the Washington Post, and they are quoting the president&#39;s own words.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Excuse me; I feel sick.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/332621752895809174'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/332621752895809174'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208211180000#c332621752895809174' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 4:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-602966670501697130</id><published>2008-04-14T13:44:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T13:44:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Man that is the worst case of suicide i have seen ...</title><content type='html'>Man that is the worst case of suicide i have seen since joe neckbone of the montana militia shot himself 16 times how did he manage to beat himself to a pulp?&lt;BR/&gt;what is our childrens learning</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/602966670501697130'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/602966670501697130'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208202240000#c602966670501697130' title=''/><author><name>captain obvious</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" v