ished>2008-04-14T11:05:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T11:05:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Is a post to come on the Fundamental LDS issue? I ...</title><content type='html'>Is a post to come on the Fundamental LDS issue? I hope so.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Conan the Cimmerian</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/1455696358948859773'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/1455696358948859773'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208192700000#c1455696358948859773' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 11:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7215742585980131824</id><published>2008-04-14T08:36:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T08:36:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>anonymous @ 11:29 -- My view is that the Bush admi...</title><content type='html'>anonymous @ 11:29 -- My view is that the Bush administration and the permanent &quot;security&quot; bureaucracy had detailed foreknowledge of the 9/11 attacks &lt;I&gt;at the very least,&lt;/I&gt; and that the most generous assessment we can make of their role was that they were knowing, passive accomplices to mass murder of Americans.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I am a persuadable agnostic regarding many of the theories circulated by the 9/11 Truth Movement. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;While at &lt;B&gt; The New American,&lt;/B&gt; I urged my editor and  JBS management to give that movement&#39;s claims a fair and respectful hearing, rather than simply assuming a priori that they were either entirely irresponsible or a form of &quot;controlled opposition,&quot; which was the JBS management&#39;s default view (their logic was that since these other movements were competitors with the Society for recruits, donations, and other resources, they just &lt;I&gt;had&lt;/I&gt; to be controlled by the &quot;Insiders&quot; somehow). &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I know Bill Jasper -- who did heroic work on the OKC bombing -- shared at least some of my views. But JBS/TNA management had no interest in pursuing the issue, in large measure for the reason described above. But they were willing to waste editorial space for petty attacks on 9/11 truth activists like Dave Von Kliest. I was originally &quot;offered&quot; the &quot;opportunity&quot; to do the Von Kliest hit piece, and turned it down.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/7215742585980131824'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/7215742585980131824'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208183760000#c7215742585980131824' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 8:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5863009062913696431</id><published>2008-04-14T07:40:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T07:40:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>These are the untold stories that need to be told....</title><content type='html'>These are the untold stories that need to be told. The blood of these innocent victims - like Tenetradueau- cry out for justice. &lt;BR/&gt;Keep up the courageous informative work.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5863009062913696431'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5863009062913696431'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208180400000#c5863009062913696431' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 7:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1296843630019907266</id><published>2008-04-14T06:31:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T06:31:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>THANK YOU, Will, for bringing the Trentadues&#39; stor...</title><content type='html'>THANK YOU, Will, for bringing the Trentadues&#39; story up to date. I had not heard a word about it for several years. Obviously the MSM is not going to touch this toxic story with a ten-mile pole.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;[The judge] gave them until May 1 to turn over the documents or be hit with a contempt citation.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Mayday, Mayday! We&#39;ll be watching.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/1296843630019907266'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/1296843630019907266'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208176260000#c1296843630019907266' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 6:31 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5363863897081972216</id><published>2008-04-14T00:29:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T00:29:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I&#39;ve been following you ever since you were ...</title><content type='html'>Will, I&#39;ve been following you ever since you were with The Birch Society and left them along with you.  The one thing that I cannot get my head past, is why you can see that the OKC event was a government job, but haven&#39;t seemed to come to the same conclusion about 9/11.  Or has your mind changed on that subject as of late?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5363863897081972216'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5363863897081972216'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208154540000#c5363863897081972216' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 12:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5504055890257357037</id><published>2008-04-14T00:26:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-04-14T00:26:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>All &quot;aryan&quot; groups are infiltrated or ran by intel...</title><content type='html'>All &quot;aryan&quot; groups are infiltrated or ran by intelligence agencies. When a bloggist or commentator, radio host starts scapegoating races i disconnect. Knowing too much and not being a high profile person can be bad for your health wonder what Mr. Trentadue knew. War on terror schmerror the war is on Jane Handbag and Joe Sixpack the un persons. Osama was known as Tim Usman when on the Criminals In Action payroll and al queda translates to the toilet both are constructs of the elites&#39; praetorian guard/schutzstaffel agencies to keep us fearful and accept every  usurpation of rights in the name of peace and safety or the illusion thereof.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5504055890257357037'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3921280774660095563/comments/default/5504055890257357037'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html?showComment=1208154360000#c5504055890257357037' title=''/><author><name>can&#39;t happen here</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/04/from-okc-to-abu-ghraib-kenneth.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3921280774660095563' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3921280774660095563' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2008 at 12:26 AM"/></entry></feed>